BT /F1 8.50 Tf 55.00 655.00 Td (- Role-Based Access Control \(RBAC\): Strict segregation between Global Platform Super Admin and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.50 Tf 55.00 641.00 Td (  Tenant Staff \(Admin, Manager, Agent\) enforced via server-side session tokens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.50 Tf 55.00 627.00 Td (- Zero-Knowledge Tenant Impersonation: All operator tenant inspections require explicit reasons) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.50 Tf 55.00 613.00 Td (  and are immutably logged to the PlatformAuditEvent table.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.50 Tf 55.00 599.00 Td (- Webhook Signature Verification: Meta Cloud API and AmwalPay webhooks validated with HMAC-SHA256.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.50 Tf 55.00 585.00 Td (- Edge Security & Rate Limiting: Public lead and booking endpoints protected against automated abuse.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.50 Tf 55.00 571.00 Td (- Clean Path URL Routing: Modern Next.js dynamic routing \(/platform/[section]\) replacing legacy hash states.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.50 Tf 55.00 557.00 Td (- Defensive Runtime Parsing: Strict Array.isArray guards across all client panels preventing UI crashes.) Tj ET
